minutes hadn't been a conversation they had been a psychological assault. Each question had been a new wound, a new way to fail, a new way to prove he was broken, stu\u2026", "want": {"x": 78.1, "y": 668.2, "w": 280.0, "h": 41.9}, "got": {"x": 78.1, "y": 666.5, "w": 280.0, "h": 36.0}}, {"id": "s20.e52", "text": "Miro figured out a long time ago that his life wasn\u2019t worth more than whatever number some asshole was willing to shout across a room. He stared up at another one now, same chipped panels, same shitty flickering light, same rust smell under\u2026", "want": {"x": 78.1, "y": 769.1, "w": 287.6, "h": 47.6}, "got": {"x": 78.1, "y": 769.1, "w": 287.6, "h": 36.0}}, {"id": "s20.e57", "text": "Miro froze. The words didn't match. The script was wrong. In every other cell, in every other warehouse, the first words from a new owner were never a greeting. They were commands. They were assessments. They were demands for submission or \u2026", "want": {"x": 78.1, "y": 769.1, "w": 287.6, "h": 93.3}, "got": {"x": 78.1, "y": 769.1, "w": 287.6, "h": 36.0}}]}, {"metrics": {"state_id": "s15", "ssim_masked": 0.7582788732180528, "pixelmatch_ratio": null, "masked_coverage": 0.9666742156333292, "bounds_ok_share": 1.0, "nav_pass_rate": 1.0, "score": 9.309368209194437}, "name": "Janitor Plus paywall (scrolled)", "tagged": 24, "taps": 0, "taps_passed": 0, "misses": []}, {"metrics": {"state_id": "s04", "ssim_masked": 0.9779143726716725, "pixelmatch_ratio": null, "masked_coverage": 1.0, "bounds_ok_share": 1.0, "nav_pass_rate": 1.0, "score": 9.955828745343345}, "name": "Notifications", "tagged": 8, "taps": 3, "taps_passed": 3, "misses": []}, {"metrics": {"state_id": "s10", "ssim_masked": 0.6564824331606817, "pixelmatch_ratio": null, "masked_coverage": 0.8060293016044457, "bounds_ok_share": 1.0, "nav_pass_rate": 1.0, "score": 9.312964866321362}, "name": "Home feed scrolled", "tagged": 62, "taps": 1, "taps_passed": 1, "misses": []}, {"metrics": {"state_id": "s11", "ssim_masked": 0.7886